#: ../../source/docs/ac_rollpitchtuning.rst:5 c53ec79445a24686a885b6f5cde2fc92
msgid "Manual tuning of Roll and Pitch"
msgstr "横滚和俯仰手动调参"

#: ../../source/docs/ac_rollpitchtuning.rst:7 f6a1d842117b45898a155065c0031fb3
msgid ""
"Manual tuning may be required to provide a stable tune before Autotune is "
"run, or if Autotune does not produce an acceptable tune. The process below "
"can be done on roll and pitch at the same time for a quick manual tune "
"**provided the aircraft is symmetrical**. If the aircraft is not "
"symmetrical, then the process should be done for roll and pitch "
"individually."
msgstr ""
"在运行 Autotune 之前，或当 Autotune "
"无法产生可接受的调参结果时，可能需要手动调参以提供稳定的初始调参。**对于对称机架**，以下流程可同时对横滚和俯仰进行快速手动调参。若机架不对称，则应分别对横滚和俯仰进行调参。"

#: ../../source/docs/ac_rollpitchtuning.rst:9 9af3251e7adf405082f6e2da6def9d54
msgid ""
"The pilot should be especially careful to ensure that :ref:`ATC_THR_MIX_MAN "
"<ATC_THR_MIX_MAN>` and :ref:`MOT_THST_HOVER <MOT_THST_HOVER>` are set "
"correctly before manual tuning is started."
msgstr ""
"在开始手动调参之前，飞手应特别注意确保 :ref:`ATC_THR_MIX_MAN <ATC_THR_MIX_MAN>` 和 "
":ref:`MOT_THST_HOVER <MOT_THST_HOVER>` 已正确设置。"

#: ../../source/docs/ac_rollpitchtuning.rst:11
#: 0f5255d08f8e42fe8b7e087b984839ac
msgid ""
"When oscillations start do not make large or sudden stick inputs. Reduce the"
" throttle smoothly to land the aircraft while using very slow and small roll"
" and pitch inputs to control the aircraft position. For each axis:"
msgstr "当振荡开始时，不要进行大幅或突然的摇杆输入。平稳降低油门降落，同时非常缓慢、小幅地进行横滚和俯仰输入以控制飞机位置。对每个轴："

#: ../../source/docs/ac_rollpitchtuning.rst:14
#: e196f6b00190477c9e8ba0a6e6556458
#, python-format
msgid ""
"If the vehicle already oscillates in an axis, first lower the P, D, and I "
"terms in 50% steps until stable, before starting manual tuning."
msgstr "若飞行器在某轴上已出现振荡，在开始手动调参前先以 50% 步进逐步降低 P、D、I 项直至稳定。"

#: ../../source/docs/ac_rollpitchtuning.rst:16
#: 8100c02ebc1747828223b1053eee5877
#, python-format
msgid "Increase the D term in steps of 50% until oscillation is observed"
msgstr "以 50% 步进逐步增大 D 项直至出现振荡"

#: ../../source/docs/ac_rollpitchtuning.rst:17
#: 89ea15a54f7d4d1e83cbd73ccce9b4df
#, python-format
msgid "Reduce the D term in steps of 10% until the oscillation disappears"
msgstr "以 10% 步进逐步降低 D 项直至振荡消失"

#: ../../source/docs/ac_rollpitchtuning.rst:18
#: 0aeef82304ae470e94868eb9ffe4f2dc
msgid "Reduce the D term by a further 25%"
msgstr "再将 D 项降低 25%"

#: ../../source/docs/ac_rollpitchtuning.rst:19
#: 0dcc2d38daea4cf4b26fd9be3ddddf71
#, python-format
msgid "Increase the P term in steps of 50% until oscillation is observed"
msgstr "以 50% 步进逐步增大 P 项直至出现振荡"

#: ../../source/docs/ac_rollpitchtuning.rst:20
#: 7c162319f5e54b13b85c7b0d457bd695
#, python-format
msgid "Reduce the P term in steps of 10% until the oscillation disappears"
msgstr "以 10% 步进逐步降低 P 项直至振荡消失"

#: ../../source/docs/ac_rollpitchtuning.rst:21
#: b6ba755bd50e44b188d3ae0bde780580
msgid "Reduce the P term by a further 25%"
msgstr "再将 P 项降低 25%"

#: ../../source/docs/ac_rollpitchtuning.rst:23
#: 7c0f7f824f5d4cf99bb7cbc546bbade2
msgid ""
"Each time the P term is changed set the I term equal to the P term. Those "
"parameters can be changed on ground and preferably disarmed. A confident "
"pilot could set them in flight with GCS or transmitter tuning knob (see "
":ref:`Transmitter based tuning<common-transmitter-tuning>` page for setup of"
" this feature)."
msgstr ""
"每次更改 P 项时，将 I 项设置为与 P "
"项相等。这些参数最好在地面且最好在上锁状态下更改。有把握的飞手也可在飞行中通过地面站或遥控器调参旋钮进行设置（调参旋钮设置方法见 :ref:`遥控器调参"
" <common-transmitter-tuning>` 页面）。"

#: ../../source/docs/ac_rollpitchtuning.rst:27
#: 6280602a979a42538760d910e9ceeea7
msgid ""
"If using :ref:`Transmitter based tuning<common-transmitter-tuning>`, set the"
" minimum value of the tuning range to the current safe value and the upper "
"range to approximately 4 times the current value. Be careful not to move the"
" slider before the parameter list is refreshed to recover the set value. "
"Ensure the transmitter tuning is switched off before setting the parameter "
"value or the tuning may immediately overwrite it."
msgstr ""
"如果使用 :ref:`遥控器调参 <common-transmitter-tuning>`，将调参范围的最小值设置为当前安全值，上限设置为当前值的约 4"
" 倍。在参数列表刷新恢复设定值之前请勿移动滑块。在设置参数值前请确保遥控器调参已关闭，否则调参可能立即覆盖设定值。"

#: ../../source/docs/ac_rollpitchtuning.rst:30
#: 97a4184319924433b1b605e9f9b3a93c
msgid "Video of in-flight tuning"
msgstr "飞行调参视频"
